# Environment Variable Configuration Template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in your project directory: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Replace the placeholder values below with your own valid credentials.
# 3. NEVER commit your actual '.env' file or any real secrets to Git.
#
# Every key is optional. With none set, rce-sentinel runs in degraded mode:
# rules + taint + reachability + local OSV cache, plus Ollama if it is running.
# rce-sentinel does not read .env itself; export these in your shell or CI.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Model providers (any subset; the router uses whichever are available) ---
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here          # Tier 1/2 (Flash-Lite, Flash)
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your_deepseek_api_key_here      # Tier 2 (V4 Flash)
# MOONSHOT_API_KEY=your_moonshot_api_key_here      # Tier 3 (Kimi)
# ZAI_API_KEY=your_zai_api_key_here                # Tier 3 (GLM)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_key_here      # optional alternative endpoint
# APFEL_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11435/v1         # base model: Apple Foundation Model via apfel
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11436/v1       # Ollama: qwen2.5:3b + gemma4:31b-cloud (11436 if apfel holds 11434)

# --- Behaviour ---
# CAVEMAN=on                          # on|off: terse agent-to-agent messages
# RCE_SENTINEL_PROVIDER=auto          # auto | hybrid (real where up, else mock) | mock | off
# RCE_SENTINEL_ESLINT_DIR=            # ESLint backend dir (default: linters/eslint)
# RCE_SENTINEL_KEY_FILE=              # signing key for cached verdicts (default: ~/.config/rce-sentinel/key)
# RCE_SENTINEL_OFFLINE=0              # 1 = never touch the network (cache only)
# RCE_SENTINEL_QUOTA=                # e.g. apple-foundationmodel=1500: after that many tokens in a run, switch model
# RCE_SENTINEL_CAVEMAN_PROBE=0        # 1 = re-run calls with caveman off to measure savings
# RCE_SENTINEL_SHADOW_RATE=0.0        # fraction of verdicts re-checked by Tier 3
# RCE_SENTINEL_HOME=.rce-sentinel     # state dir (SQLite memory, reports, proposals)
# RCE_SENTINEL_CONFIG_DIR=            # override directory for models/policy/sources/rules

# --- Threat intel (all optional) ---
# NVD_API_KEY=your_free_nvd_key       # raises NVD rate limits
# GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token      # raises GHSA rate limits (no scopes needed)
# X_BEARER_TOKEN=your_x_api_token     # paid X API v2; collector stays off without it

# --- Notifications (host must be in sources.yaml allowed_hosts) ---
# SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/XXX/YYY/ZZZ
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/XXX/YYY
